Function names used elsewhere in this lesson: _binding_state_for_step, state_is_binding_init, state_is_binding_step, state_is_binding_view

## Output

Return one JSON object in the same shape as before, and nothing else:
`{"prose": ..., "widget": ..., "functions": [...]}`

