- [ERROR] walk-not-write-order/review: reviewing 'three instances that reference their subnet and security group': In the module's own graph, only instance_1 and instance_3 depend on the security group. `deps["instance_2"] = ["subnet_a"]` — instance_2 has no edge to security_group. A learner reading the prose and then reasoning about the timeline (e.g. why instance_2 can start before security_group finishes at concurrency 2) would be working from a graph the code does not implement. Suggested fix: Either change the prose to "three instances that reference a subnet, and two of them a security group as well", or add "security_group" to instance_2's dependency list in both dag_schedule and critical_path_time (this does not change any of the reported totals).

